amh in a fierce battle to retake magic from Sun King Azra’s grasp in Absolum, an original roguelite beat ‘em up by Dotemu.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFEATURES\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u200b🌌 Join the rebellion! With the help of the high enchantress Uchawi, wield forbidden magic to free the lands of Talamh from the iron grip of Sun King Azra.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e⚔️ Four heroes, each with their own fighting style: start playing as the calm but deadly Galandra or as Karl, the last free dwarf of Talamh, and discover the prodigious Brome and the enigmatic Cider as they join your journey.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e💥 Craft new strategies and get more powerful every run to defeat Azra’s elite guard through a gameplay that blends the best of arcade beat’em up action with modern roguelite mechanics.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u200b🗺️ -From the majestic mines of Grandery to the lush forests of Jaroba, delve into an original fantasy world that comes alive through gorgeous art, masterful animation and a magnificent soundtrack by composer Gareth Coker (Ori, Halo Infinite, Prince of Persia), featuring collaborations with other legendary composers.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u200b🤝 Lead the uprising against Azra\u0026#39;s regime as a lone hero, or team up with an ally through the two-player online coop mode. Combine your elemental powers and synchronize your attacks into incredible chained combos!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eCAREFULLY REDESIGNED FOR MOBILE\u003cbr\u003e- Revamped interface – exclusive mobile UI with complete touch control\u003cbr\u003e- Google Play Games achievements\u003cbr\u003e-Buy once, play anywhere: Enjoy cross-progression on mobile and PC with the same Google Play Games account\u003cbr\u003e- Cloud Save – Share your progress between Android devices\u003cbr\u003e-Compatible with controllers"],"Playdigious","",null,"",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/0TndEm30Z3BJvaBfFRX2Eng5Q6zYrLxN739l-RZofN