s for real money, please disable in-app purchases in your device\u0026#39;s settings.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eClassic Features:\u003cbr\u003e● Build and battle in real time: Customize your layout and level up each building to strengthen your defense in war.\u003cbr\u003e● Assemble an army with countless combinations of spells, troops, and Heroes! \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eMultiplayer:\u003cbr\u003e● Build a team and battle in Clan Wars against millions of active online players across the globe.\u2028Test your fighting skills in the competitive Clan War Leagues and prove your Clan is the best around!\u003cbr\u003e● Collect resources and plunder loot from other players to upgrade your village. Use strategy and smarts to defend your Town Hall building in war!\u003cbr\u003e● \ufeff\ufeffTest your fighting skills in Ranked Mode and take part in competitive online multiplayer battles with players from around the world. Prove your dominance and rise all the way to Legend League.\u003cbr\u003e● Keep your Clan Castle building safe and craft your defense strategy against enemy attacks. Build Towers, Cannons, Bombs, traps, Mortars, and walls to give you the edge in multiplayer battles.\u003cbr\u003e● \ufeff\ufeffAdventure with epic Heroes, like Barbarian King, Archer Queen, Grand Warden, Royal Champion, Minion Prince, Dragon Duke, and Battle Machine.\u003cbr\u003e● Use your Laboratory building to make your troops, spells, and Siege Machines even more powerful in war.\u003cbr\u003e● Flex your strategy in real time: take part in free online multiplayer games. Battle through Friendly Challenges, Friendly Wars, and special live multiplayer war game events.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eSingle Player:\u003cbr\u003e● Start fighting against the Goblin King in a single-player campaign mode and become a hero of the realm.\u003cbr\u003e● \ufeff\ufeffLearn new strategy tactics and experiment with army combinations and Clan Castle troops in Practice Mode.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eBuilder Base:\u003cbr\u003e● Adventure to the mysterious shores of Builder Base and discover new buildings, characters, and a whole new way to play.\u003cbr\u003e● Turn your Builder Base into an unbeatable fortress. Build up your defenses and perfect your fighting strategy. Conquer rival players in real time in the online multiplayer Versus Battle war game mode.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWhat are you waiting for, Chief? Get ready to conquer! Join the adventure today.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eA network connection is also required.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eIf you have fun playing Clash of Clans, you may also enjoy other free multiplayer Supercell games like Clash Royale, Brawl Stars, Boom Beach, and Hay Day. Make sure to check those out!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eSupport: Chief, are you having problems? Visit https://help.supercellsupport.com/clash-of-clans/en/index.html or contact us in-game by going to Settings \u0026gt; Help and Support.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003ePrivacy Policy: http://www.supercell.net/privacy-policy/\u003cbr\u003eTerms of Service: http://www.supercell.net/terms-of-service/\u003cbr\u003eParent’s Guide: http://www.supercell.net/parents\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe IGRS Rating for this game is 15+\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eNotice of Access Permission:\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e[Optional permission]\u003cbr\u003eClash of Clans may request permission via in-game pop ups to access your camera and send you notifications.\u003cbr\u003eCamera: For in-game scanning of QR codes\u003cbr\u003eNotifications: For sending notifications related to the game\u003cbr\u003eConsent is optional and you can use the app and play the game regardless of whether or not you consent. You may refuse to give consent within the game. However, certain app features may not work properly if you refuse optional access permissions."],"Supercell","500,000,000+",null,"",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/jrHf2XyMI1_PTH3Z_fHXF