ns rages on. And then there are the Dimensional heroes, visiting from distant worlds. Discover their skills and captivating backstories.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eExcellent Graphics | Immersive, Vast Magical World\u003cbr\u003eExplore the storybook-style magical world, where every detail is meticulously crafted.\u003cbr\u003eRoam through forests and mountains, using vines and tree stumps to bridge waterfalls and rivers as you take in the stunning scenery. Along the way, enjoy a range of interactive experiences, such as petting stray cats on the streets, going ice-skating, and having snowball fights... Every moment is full of surprises!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eEpic Adventures | Uncover Secrets as Magister Merlin\u003cbr\u003eA new adventure awaits with every season!\u003cbr\u003eLong ago, the seed of life drifted to Esperia from the stars and took root, giving birth to a land of wonder. However, as the gods fell during a chaotic war, six great factions emerged, each vying for power and dominance. Remember, only you can guide heroes to pull \u0026quot;\u0026quot;the sword from the stone\u0026quot;\u0026quot; and learn the truth about the world.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eCollect Resources Quickly | Level Up Fast\u003cbr\u003eSay goodbye to grinding for resources. Collect rewards effortlessly with our auto-battle and AFK features. Continue gathering resources even while you\u0026#39;re sleeping.\u003cbr\u003eEnjoy hassle-free resource collection and smooth, rewarding progression!"],"FARLIGHT","5,000,000+",null,"",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/VGDB6eiMrxzk6Au5pcmCjPTML5t9-6-H3iRQu3ZZmiDDTGzLCpYDBdNeBDrw0HF0ipZcYfrEH6eN0zjdDjaT2eA"],null,[252,234,166,255]],null,["Teen",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mw_NfsvKM8m6RPv8Fz2GQawCOsqWv010saMnc7zbWalMxuaA9IY8h7E0VMieLxSxAFB98NFeYqbFrXXq"]],[null,"Violence, Blood"],[null,"Users Interact, In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)"],