l,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,"/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.wb.goog.hotd.socialstrategy\u0026pcampaignid\u003dmerch_published_cluster_promotion_battlestar_collection_new_games"]],["\u003d\u003d"],null,[null,"Command legendary dragons, forge powerful alliances, and conquer the Seven Kingdoms in the ultimate Game of Thrones strategy game. Build your empire, raise a fearsome dragon army, and wage RTS war across Westeros to claim the Iron Throne. Game of Thrones: Dragonfire is an epic 4X strategy war game where you lead your House through conquest, diplomacy, and dragon warfare in the most immersive medieval fantasy game on mobile.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eCOLLECT \u0026amp; COMMAND MIGHTY DRAGONS\u003cbr\u003eHatch, train, and command legendary dragons. Battle with Syrax, Caraxes, Seasmoke, and more. Each dragon possesses unique abilities to turn the tide of tactical warfare. Build an unstoppable dragon army, collect rare species, and evolve them into forces of pure destruction to dominate the skies of Westeros.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWAGE EPIC STRATEGIC WARFARE\u003cbr\u003eLead your armies in high-stakes PvP war and real time strategy combat. Lay siege to enemy strongholds, defend your castle, and outmaneuver rival Houses in thrilling battles. Whether engaging in PvE campaigns or global clan wars, your mastery of RTS mechanics and cunning strategy will determine who reigns supreme. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eBUILD \u0026amp; UPGRADE YOUR KINGDOM\u003cbr\u003eMaster base building as you grow a small stronghold into an unassailable fortress. Manage vital resources to fuel your conquest of Westeros and train elite troops in this thrilling battle game. Effective kingdom management and defensive upgrades are the keys to surviving the brutal politics of the Seven Kingdoms. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eCONQUER THE SEVEN KINGDOMS\u003cbr\u003eExplore a detailed map of Westeros featuring iconic landmarks like the Red Keep, Dragonstone, and Harrenhal. Expand your empire across legendary regions, conquer rival territories, and control the most powerful strongholds in the realm. In this MMO strategy world, every territory claimed brings you closer to the Iron Throne.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eDISCOVER EPIC STORYLINES\u003cbr\u003eStep into the official game of the HBO show House of the Dragon, set 172 years before Daenerys Targaryen. Immerse yourself in a narrative-rich campaign where your decisions shape the destiny of the realm. Interact with iconic characters like Rhaenyra Targaryen and Daemon Targaryen in a story filled with the drama, betrayal, and intrigue that defines Game of Thrones.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFORGE MULTIPLAYER ALLIANCES\u003cbr\u003eJoin forces with players worldwide in this massive multiplayer strategy MMO. Coordinate grand strategies with your alliance, dominate the world map, and wage war against rival factions. In a land of shifting loyalties, strong diplomacy and coordinated alliance warfare are essential to securing your legacy. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWHY PLAY GAME OF THRONES: DRAGONFIRE?\u003cbr\u003e• The Definitive GoT Strategy Game: Officially licensed medieval fantasy RPG and war game.\u003cbr\u003e• Deep 4X Gameplay: Explore, expand, exploit and exterminate in a massive world.\u003cbr\u003e• Stunning Visuals: High-fidelity graphics bring the dragons and strongholds of Westeros to life. \u003cbr\u003e• Live Events: Regular updates featuring new dragons, seasonal events, and storylines. \u003cbr\u003e• Global PvP: Compete against thousands of strategists in real-time throne battles. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eDownload Game of Thrones: Dragonfire now and begin your conquest! The battle for the Seven Kingdoms has begun; Will you command the fire and claim the throne?"],"Warner Bros. International Enterprises","1,000,000+",null,"",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/und6tsSl_xoEE4YTA38ERKbDSH7rgC5wt