any survivors, start expeditions to meet the heroes of this post-apocalyptic reality, challenge other players in PvP matches and helicopter raids, and show your shooting skills. Zombie action game begins… now!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eProtect humanity from HORDES OF ZOMBIES\u003cbr\u003eThe world is teeming with the undead. No place to run or to hide. Become a hero of this zombie-apocalypse reality and shoot up all the zombies. Start the Campaign, follow the story, and rid the Earth of the undead hordes!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWide variety of ARMOR at your service!\u003cbr\u003eOn your mission to save the world from zombies, a huge range of weapons and gear will be at your service. Make a choice from assault weapons and sniper rifles to machine guns and shotguns that will help you destroy the undead. Equip your hero with gear to enhance his skills and powers. Upgrade and evolve weapons and gear and make heroes more powerful.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eUnite them ALL!\u003cbr\u003eMeet all the heroes of the zombie-apocalypse world. Back in the day, they were ordinary humans. Now it’s their duty to protect the world. Each has unique skills and abilities. Upgrade and evolve them to level up their powers. Gather survivors to give them new hope and improve your base.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eEngines checked, ready to RAID BASES\u003cbr\u003eRaid enemy bases in the action game. Zombie apocalypse has come and only the strongest will survive. Raid with your helicopter and collect resources. Be prepared for a “warm” welcome: bases are protected by towers and local troops. Equip the helicopter with weapons and upgrade it to succeed.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eChallenge other players in PvP MATCHES\u003cbr\u003eTest your skills in PvP matches and become the best shooter. It’s the perfect chance to gain experience and prepare for zombies. Play 2x2 or solo. Team up with clanmates and challenge other players together.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eBuild your BASE!\u003cbr\u003eTo survive and make the future bright, build a new home for yourself and survivors – your base. Turn it into a place where everyone can find shelter and feel safe: produce food and resources, arm your heroes, modify weapons. Fortify it to protect from raids and looting.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFollow us on Facebook https://www.facebook.com/LeftToSurvive\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eIf you have a problem with this game, please contact us at: https://support.my.games/lts  \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003ePlease note: Left to Survive is free to play, but some items can be purchased for real money. In-App purchases may include random items.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003ePremium Survival Pass is a monthly subscription ($9.99) that lets you build and upgrade two buildings at once and boosts mission rewards:\u003cbr\u003e+40% experience\u003cbr\u003e+40% cash\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eIt also unlocks special Survivors who defend your base and increase production:\u003cbr\u003e+50% oil\u003cbr\u003e+40% material\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003ePayment is charged to your Google Play Account at purchase and monthly renewal. Auto-renews unless turned off 24h before period ends. Manage in Account Settings. Active period cannot be canceled.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- For information about how MY.GAMES collects and uses your data, please read our privacy policy at: https://documentation.my.games/terms/mygames_privacy\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e- Terms of Use: https://documentation.my.games/terms/mygames_eula \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eBrought to you by MY.GAMES\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e© 2026 MY.GAMES HOLDINGS LTD. All rights reserved. All trademarks are the property of their respective owners."],"MY.GAMES HOLDINGS LTD","50,000,000+",null,"",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/E7QYQW_-Ph4_ufezdfODJrgn4iQ0w4KJl_VH7ow0Lc_JoXfb1W6b8A8rBRKIrU5KRJBCnY0_0XgeC3oAqJ9mHCs"],null,[47,52,54,255]],null,["Mature 17+