WB0W8nEGYgAzQGQMikKB-Yvk7UUfqCflmsNzevAcg\u003d\u003d"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/zjdUU4c5Fzs/hqdefault.jpg"]]]],[null,"Welcome to a world where your imagination comes first! ✨ Make up stories in the colourful locations, and customize your own buildings – you can style your own outfits too!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eToca Boca World is all about open-ended play. 🥳 There are no rules, just colorful ways to be creative. Build your world, and fill it with characters, pets, shops and all kinds of houses!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAlmost everything inside Toca Boca World is customizable, or you can jump straight in and play! 🛝 Try running a café, become a hair stylist, camp in the forest or throw a rooftop party. It’s a safe universe where kids explore and discover at their own pace.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eBUILD YOUR OWN WORLD\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e🏬 Explore apartments, shops and hangouts in Bop City \u003cbr\u003e👭 Design your own characters with unique hair, faces, outfits and accessories \u003cbr\u003e🏡  Decorate spaces with Home Designer. Change the walls, furniture and colors \u003cbr\u003e🐶 Add pets, food, toys and silly items so each place feels like your own\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003ePLAY YOUR WAY\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e🤘 Create your own stories. Become a chef, spa owner, rockstar, or teacher \u003cbr\u003e🏭  Mix and match locations to invent your own mini games and challenges \u003cbr\u003e🚌 Move characters between homes, schools, shops and secret spots \u003cbr\u003e🏥 Try roleplay like running a pet hospital, opening a fashion studio or hosting a sleepover\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eEXPLORE, DISCOVER AND COLLECT\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e💎 Find hidden gems, secret rooms and surprises in the locations\u003cbr\u003e🎁 Visit the Post Office every Friday for free gifts including furniture, outfits, decorations and pets\u003cbr\u003e🌎 Grow your world as new packs and locations are added to the in-app shop\u003cbr\u003e\