 | Claim Launch Heroes\u003cbr\u003eLog in and claim all launch heroes!\u003cbr\u003eBegin your journey with your dream formation!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003ePlay Smart | Adapt Formations for Different Strategies\u003cbr\u003ePower isn\u0026#39;t everything! It\u0026#39;s possible to defeat stronger opponents with your wit and strategy!\u003cbr\u003eDeploy heroes from six classes, position them strategically, and time their ultimates to overcome your enemies! Use faction buffs, terrain, and battle mechanics to your advantage!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eShared Levels | Deploy New Heroes Immediately\u003cbr\u003eEquipment and levels are shared across heroes. No more grinding!\u003cbr\u003eFeel free to try out different formations at zero cost!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e100 Heroes | Original and Unique Designs\u003cbr\u003eMeet 100 heroes from seven factions!\u003cbr\u003eWitness the Lightbearers, who carry the pride of humanity. Watch the Wilders flourish at the heart of their forest. Observe how the Maulers survive against all odds through sheer strength. The Graveborn legions are amassing, and the eternal clash between the Celestials and the Hypogeans rages on. And then there are the Dimensional heroes, visiting from distant worlds. Discover their skills and captivating backstories.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eExcellent Graphics | Immersive, Vast Magical World\u003cbr\u003eExplore the storybook-style magical world, where every detail is meticulously crafted.\u003cbr\u003eRoam through forests and mountains, using vines and tree stumps to bridge waterfalls and rivers as you take in the stunning scenery. Along the way, enjoy a range of interactive experiences, such as petting stray cats on the streets, going ice-skating, and having snowball fights... Every moment is full of surprises!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eEpic Adventures | Uncover Secrets as Magister Merlin\u003cbr\u003eA new adventure awaits with every season!\u003cbr\u003eLong ago, the seed of life drifted to E